Package: WildObsR
Type: Package
Title: Discover, Access and Harmonise WildObs Camera Trap Data
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Zachary", "Amir", email = "z.amir@uq.edu.au",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8398-2059"))
Maintainer: Zachary Amir <z.amir@uq.edu.au>
Description: Find, download and prepare camera trap data from WildObs, the
    Australian national wildlife camera database, for analysis. Projects are found
    by place, time, species, sampling design or contributor, and downloaded as
    Camera Trap Data Packages ('Camtrap DP', <https://camtrap-dp.tdwg.org/>) that
    carry their licences and citations. Data from many projects can then be
    harmonised to a shared spatial and temporal scale, given spatial context
    (state, bioregion, protected area) and turned into detection histories with
    sampling effort and covariates for occupancy and abundance models.
